, Lee debuted as a new member of SeeYa in 2009. She was active in SeeYa for a short time before joining the new co-ed group Coed School in 2010. After Coed School split, the female members became the new girl group F-ve Dolls in 2011, with Lee as the oldest member. In 2012, Lee terminated her contract with Core Contents Media and signed to D-Business Entertainment in 2013 to pursue her solo career. After taking a break for three years, Lee transitioned into acting and is currently signed to Billions.","title":"Lee Seo-an","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lee_Seo-an"}},"Q495020":{"id":"Q495020","name":"Han Seung-yeon","ko":"한승연","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Han Seung Yeon","Han Seungyeon","Han Seung-yun","Han Seung Yun","Han Seungyun","Hahn Seung-yeon","Hahn Seung Yeon","Hahn Seungyeon"],"birth":"1988-07-24","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor","film actor","pop singer","television actor"],"debut":"2007","agencies":[{"name":"DSP Media","korean":true,"id":"Q489428","start":"","end":""},{"name":"Rainbow Bridge World","korean":true,"id":"Q16174772","start":"","end":""},{"name":"Universal Music Group","korean":false,"id":"Q38903","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q124459","name":"Kara","start":"2007","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/thesy88/","x":"https://x.com/fateflysy","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFjTUKj2cAGYrg24rqqF4sQ","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/5kUgUgo1jFoAOiaiv8OP0o","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/7ab9ca34-6d8a-4418-9884-9a30011dd7ca"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Han Seung-yeon, known mononymously as Seungyeon, is a South Korean singer and actress. She is best known as the vocalist of the South Korean girl group Kara, and for her role in Hello, My Twenties!.","title":"Han Seung-yeon","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Han_Seung-yeon"}},"Q55734060":{"id":"Q55734060","name":"Jung Da-eun","ko":"정다은",